u1-wasm: mesh STEP solids with OCCT's serial mesher.

BRepMesh_IncrementalMesh(..., isInParallel=true) starts OSD thread-pool threads
and blocks joining them. In a browser, a new pthread's Web Worker only starts
once the creating thread yields to its event loop, so the join never returns
and STEP import hangs (Node starts workers independently, so the CLI worked).
The tessellation itself is unchanged.

